  "preamble": "A velar stop becomes the velar nasal [ŋ] by assimilation to a neighbouring nasal. This happens synchronically in Korean nasal assimilation and in Sanskrit sandhi, and it was grammaticalized as the Welsh nasal mutation, which comes from a lost preceding nasal.",
  "phoneticEffects": "Nasal Assimilation, Nasalization",
